    "long_instructions": "# Attack, Heal, or Bonus\r\n\r\n1. Create a function called `updateStats` that takes in one parameter.\r\n2. Use conditionals to check if the value of the parameter is set to \"attack\", \"heal\" or \"bonus\" and update the score and health variables accordingly.\r\n3. Display the updated score and health values on screen.\r\n\r\n_Challenge: Create a fourth button for `Battle` or another action of your choice and update the function and display._",
    "display_name": "Attack, Defend, or Heal",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Code a function that takes in a parameter and updates the score and health variables.",
